      "description": "Interior Mortuary Temple of Keops - GIZA | EGYPT\n\nThe “mortuary temple” of Keops, also known as the funerary temple, is a structure that was part of the funerary complex of the Great Pyramid of Giza. This temple, located east of the pyramid, was the site of funeral and ceremonial rituals related to the pharaoh Cheops (or Khufu, in Egyptian).\n\nFab Store : https://www.fab.com/listings/45daca0c-82b4-4799-80af-b42796217764"
